<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cygnus cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cygnus cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Doug Lind said he cut his rating on Cygnus Inc to attractive from buy because human testing on its GlucoWatch painless, continuous glucose monitoring device will be delayed by another three months.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our belief that this product will eventully become a success remains intact, and we now project the launch of the product in the second half of 1998,&quot; Lind said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down two at 12-3/4.</p>
</text>
